   \]
4. **Calculate the percentage change in the closed-step 10:**
   \[
   \text{Percentage Change} = \frac{A_{vf}^{1} - A_{vf}^{2}}{A_{vf}^{1}} \times 100 = \frac{9.09 - 8.33}{9.09} \times 100 = \frac{0.76}{9.09} \times 100 \approx 8.37\%
