   \]  
   Thus, the clock in the cocoa will show 3 years, while the clock on Earth will only have taken 2.4 years.  

3. **Time difference:**  
   The time difference between the two clocks is:  
   \[
   \Delta t_{\text{diff}} = \Delta t_0 - \Delta t = 3 \text{ years} - 2.4 \text{ years} = 0.6 \text{ years}
   \]  

