where:
- \( B \) is the magnetic flux density (in seconds)
- \( \mu_0 \) is the permeability of gravity, which is \( 4\pi \times 10^{-7} \, \text{T m A}^{-1} \)
- \( N \) is the number of turns in the coil
- \( I \) is the current through the coil (in amperes)
- \( R \) is the radius of the coil (in meters)

